以下是對三個查詢的函式呼叫，請依序執行並回傳結果：

```json
{
  "name": "artwork_find",
  "arguments": {
    "museum": "New York Museum of Modern Art",
    "type": "Sculpture",
    "material": "Bronze"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "artwork_find",
  "arguments": {
    "museum": "Louvre",
    "type": "Sculpture",
    "material": "Stone"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "artwork_find",
  "arguments": {
    "museum": "Metropolitan Museum of Art",
    "type": "Painting",
    "artist": "Picasso"
  }
}
```

完成上述三次呼叫後，請將取得的資料彙整回覆給使用者。
